.\" zvolreport(1) — manual page, mdoc. Kept true to the program by
.\" tests/man-check.sh.
.Dd September 27, 2026
.Dt ZVOLREPORT 1
.Os zvolrescue 0.9.11
.Sh NAME
.Nm zvolreport
.Nd one checkable report out of the evidence logs of the zvolrescue tools
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar global options
.Cm build
.Fl o Ar report.json
.Op Ar options
.Ar log ...
.Nm
.Op Ar global options
.Cm verify
.Op Ar options
.Ar report.json
.Nm
.Op Ar global options
.Cm keygen
.Fl o Ar key
.Op Fl -public Ar key.pub
.Op Fl -force
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
consolidates the JSON Lines evidence logs that
.Xr zvolrescue 1
and its companions write into one report with a hash chain a third
party can recompute: every input and output the logs name, with the
hashes recorded at the time, and optionally an Ed25519 signature over
the report.
.Cm verify
recomputes the hashes against the files as they are now and says what
still matches.
.Sh GLOBAL OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl f , Fl -format Ar text | json
Output format; text is the default.
.It Fl v , Fl -verbose
Increase verbosity; repeatable.
.It Fl q , Fl -quiet
Suppress non-essential output.
.It Fl -evidence-log Ar file
Append a JSON Lines evidence log of this run to
.Ar file .
.It Fl -hash-inputs
Also record the SHA-256 of every input in the evidence log.
.It Fl -no-color
Disable colour in text output.
.It Fl -debug , Fl -debug-log Ar file
Trace every decision, to standard error or to
.Ar file .
.It Fl V , Fl -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh COMMANDS
.Ss build
.Nm Cm build
.Fl o Ar report.json
.Op Ar options
.Ar log ...
.Pp
Consolidate evidence logs into one report.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl o , Fl -output Ar report.json
Write the report here.
Neither it, the Markdown nor the signature may be one of the logs, the
signing key or the run's own
.Fl -debug-log
(exit 5), or each other (exit 1).
.It Fl -md Ar report.md
Also render the report as Markdown.
.It Fl -case Ar id
Case identifier, as it appears on the report.
.It Fl -examiner Ar name
Who is doing the examination.
.It Fl -note Ar text
A note to carry in the report; repeatable.
.It Fl -sign Ar keyfile
Sign the report with this Ed25519 private key (unencrypted PKCS#8,
the form
.Ql openssl genpkey -algorithm ed25519
writes), leaving the raw 64-byte signature beside it.
.It Fl -signature Ar report.json.sig
Write the signature here instead of next to the report.
.El
.Ss verify
.Nm Cm verify
.Op Ar options
.Ar report.json
.Pp
Recompute the hashes a report recorded and say what still matches.
A
.Fl -debug-log
on any file the report names, as
.Nm
will look for it, is refused with exit 5 before anything is opened.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -evidence-root Ar dir
Look for the evidence under this directory instead of the path
recorded; the disks are rarely mounted where they were.
.It Fl -outputs-root Ar dir
Look for the extracted files under this directory.
.It Fl -key Ar keyfile
Also check the report's signature against this Ed25519 public key
(SubjectPublicKeyInfo, the form
.Ql openssl pkey -pubout
writes).
.It Fl -signature Ar report.json.sig
Read the signature here instead of next to the report.
.El
.Ss keygen
.Nm Cm keygen
.Fl o Ar key
.Op Fl -public Ar key.pub
.Op Fl -force
.Pp
Write a new Ed25519 key pair to sign reports with.
The private key is written owner-only (mode 0600).
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl o , Fl -output Ar key
Write the private key here, and the public key at
.Ar key Ns .pub .
.It Fl -public Ar key.pub
Write the public key here instead.
.It Fl -force
Replace a key pair that is already there; without it an existing
.Ar key
or
.Ar key.pub
is refused.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when the report was built, or when everything it names still
verifies; 1 for a usage error; 2 when a log or a file the report names
cannot be read; 3 when something no longer matches.
.Sh EXAMPLES
A signed report of one case, and its check on another machine:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
zvolreport keygen -o examiner.key
zvolreport build --case RT-4471 --examiner "A. Examiner" \e
    --sign examiner.key -o case.json --md case.md case42.jsonl
zvolreport verify --key examiner.key.pub \e
    --evidence-root /mnt/images --outputs-root /mnt/rescue case.json
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zvolcarve 1 ,
.Xr zvolfiles 1 ,
.Xr zvolrescue 1 ,
.Xr zvoltimeline 1
